  - title: The slush debate
    number: 2
    heartsNeeded: 2
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - Okay, settle this. Blue slush or red slush?
    - Wrong. Wait, you didn't say anything yet. Whatever you were going to say, if it wasn't blue, it was wrong.
    - Red slush is for people who've given up on life. Blue slush is for people with hope. Look it up.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
      questText: 
      reminder: []
      thanks: []
    choice:
      enabled: 0
