      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      friendship: 0
  - title: The man on the touchline
    number: 5
    heartsNeeded: 5
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - There was a man at practice today. On the touchline, with a clipboard and a Sterling jacket. He didn't watch anybody else. Just me.
    - Coach says he's a scout. From the academy in the city. The proper one, with the big pitches and the TV cameras.
    - I played like a donkey after that. My legs forgot how legs work.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
      questText: 
      reminder: []
      thanks: []
    choice:
      enabled: 0
      optionA: 
      replyA: []
      flagsA: []
      optionB: 
      replyB: []
      flagsB: []
    setFlags: []
    reward:
      gold: 0
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      friendship: 0
  - title: The offer
    number: 6
    heartsNeeded: 6
    path: 0
    conditions:
      days: 0
      seasons: 0
      dayFrom: 0
      dayTo: 0
      minYear: 0
      minTotalDays: 0
      weather: 0
      requireFlags: []
      anyFlags: []
      forbidFlags: []
      counters: []
    pages:
    - The academy wants me. Boarding school, in the city. Training every day, all paid for. Sterling Sports Academy.
    - If I'm good enough there, I could play properly. Like, for a living.
    - I'd only be home on Sundays. Mum would be on her own all week. She's already on her own most of the week. I'm the one who does the dishes.
    happy: 0
    ask:
      item: {fileID: 0}
      amount: 0
      minQuality: 0
      questTitle: 
      questText: 
      reminder: []
      thanks: []
